    "title": "Major disaster declaration approved for 7 Ohio counties - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Other News ,\n4 hours ago COLUMBUS — Gov. Mike DeWine was notified by the Federal Emergency Management Agency on Oct. 2 that President Donald Trump approved a Presidential Major Disaster Declaration for seven Ohio counties impacted by severe weather in August. The counties approved for federal disaster assistance are Clermont, Franklin, Hamilton, Licking, Morgan,... Read full article\n4",
